From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 10:20:14 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(odo): classify competitors before they can appear in a
 report
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Adds odo-competitors.ts: every competitor candidate is now verified via
Places API (New) and scored for service/geographic overlap before it can
be labeled a competitor. Classification tiers (confirmed/probable/
comparable/irrelevant/insufficient_evidence) sit on top of the existing
3-state Determination model — no new confidence scale.

Only confirmed_competitor and probable_competitor are report-safe
(reportableCompetitors()); everything else stays internal.

Also migrates fetchGoogleBusiness off the deprecated findplacefromtext
endpoint to Places API (New), same endpoint family the new module uses.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
